Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
  models/physical_guidance.py            NEW — inference-time physical guidance
                                         module (MACE-OFF24 atomic forces +
                                         PyTorch ligand-protein interaction
                                         energy gradient)

  models/model.py                        MODIFIED — guidance hooks in the
                                         reverse-diffusion loop
  scripts/sample.py                      MODIFIED — guided sampling entry point
  scripts/evaluate.py                    MODIFIED — evaluation additions
  configs/sample/sample.yml              MODIFIED — guidance configuration
  utils/data.py, utils/parser.py,
  utils/evaluation/eval_atom_type.py     MODIFIED — minor support changes

  utils/paths.py                         NEW — central path resolution.
                                         All base directories are resolved
                                         relative to the repository root and
                                         can be overridden by environment
                                         variables (see the module docstring).

  scripts/*, configs/*                   MODIFIED — hardcoded absolute paths
                                         from the original working environment
                                         replaced with utils.paths lookups or
                                         repository-relative paths, so a fresh
                                         clone runs without editing any file.

  check_diffgui_deps.py                  FIXED — two string literals broken
                                         across lines by an upstream typo made
                                         the file fail to parse. Corrected.

  scripts/*                              Analysis and evaluation scripts
                                         written for the accompanying
                                         manuscript
  data/*                                 Generated ligand conformations and
                                         evaluation results (see README)

Not redistributed here (obtain from the original sources)
---------------------------------------------------------
  - DiffGui pretrained model weights
  - MACE-OFF24 machine-learning interatomic potential
  - PDBbind benchmark structures
